16:44.450 --> 16:45.210
Macam mana?

16:46.210 --> 16:46.970
Macam mana?

16:47.240 --> 16:48.050
Macam mana?

16:48.090 --> 16:49.210
Berpisahlah!

16:49.570 --> 16:50.970
